  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.163\n\nReleased on 2026-10-16.\n\nWebsite captures keep inline SVG logos whole, and timed SVG clips hide outside their window. Publishing now asks you to log in when it needs an account.\n\n## Features\n\n- **CLI:** Judge text behind a transparent video by its decoded alpha in check ([cea8aa8a7de](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/cea8aa8a7dee9d669e47e4b488213008bbe305cd), [#5657](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5657)).\n- **CLI:** Render telemetry reports how busy the machine's CPU was ([0e9f380c2e2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/0e9f380c2e2295db4b88945a77cfa81001ac5c27), [#5646](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5646)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **CLI:** Ask to log in when publishing needs an account ([917ee5d3134](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/917ee5d31342f8c8a4a14659679762489cafe665), [#5670](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5670)).\n- **Core:** Timed svg clips hide outside their window ([1ee6754f710](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/1ee6754f7106335cc5533f7205bd3b7949ddb887), [#5661](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5661)).\n- **CLI:** Capture writes inline SVG logos whole and parakeet takes long audio ([0d6bdd453bb](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/0d6bdd453bbcfae2280cf2b66f0b6b5afccc10ba), [#5662](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5662)).\n- **CLI:** Skip runtime by-products when fingerprinting a skill bundle ([08ee1bd5ad5](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/08ee1bd5ad59987a7f2525222683e24ca30971f9), [#5654](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5654)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Studio:** Re-run an edit accuracy shard on a fresh runner when its runner is too slow ([a403ea1e8b2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/a403ea1e8b283c6bdcbe21b5cab2a2a50b5f35f3), [#5659](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/5659)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.162...v0.8.163\n"
